<title>FRANCE: Templeton holds 5.01 pct of BNP.</title>
<headline>Templeton holds 5.01 pct of BNP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French financial markets regulator CMF said on Monday that U.S. fund Templeton Global Investors Inc holds 5.01 percent of the capital of Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) through investment funds and client accounts.</p>
<p>CMF says this stake represents 5.03 percent of BNP voting rights.</p>
<p>CMF did not say how much of BNP Templeton held before the purchases.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
